@episode main/route/luca:11 "Compulsive Protector" {

// BEAT 1 — Westbluff hallway. Monday morning. Diego's silent flicker.

@bg set school_hallway
@music play theme_school_hallway_monday

NARRATOR: Monday. First period.

@selena show backpack_walking_steady at center

YOU: Diego at the end of the corridor.

@diego show eyes_lifting_distant at right

YOU: He sees me. He sees me see him. The look lasts maybe a second and a half.

YOU: He turns into his classroom. Doesn't speak. Doesn't slow.

@diego hide

YOU: Half a second.

YOU: Not closure. Not a fight. Not even a cold shoulder. Just — a flicker.

@selena look one_breath_held_eyes_to_floor

YOU: I don't know what to do with a flicker. I have a flowchart for cold. I have a flowchart for fight. A flicker is a new genre.

@luca show approaching_easy_steps at left

YOU: Luca is half a step behind me. He saw it. He doesn't say anything about it. He doesn't ask. He doesn't grin.

YOU: He just falls into step.

@luca look glance_sideways_no_grin

LUCA: You good.

SELENA: Don't ask me that.

@luca look small_nod_eyes_forward

LUCA: Bet.

@selena look quarter_smile_small_breath

YOU: He didn't push. He just — registered, and shut up.

YOU: That is not the Luca I have been arguing with for a decade.

@selena hide
@luca hide

@pause for 1

// BEAT 2 — Westbluff hallway. Locker. Luca's reflex.

@bg set school_hallway
@music crossfade theme_school_hallway_monday

@selena show locker_open_phone_check at center
@luca show leaning_against_lockers at left

YOU: I'm at my locker. I have three texts in my draft folder I have not sent.

YOU: One to Diego. One to Diego. One to Diego.

@luca look glance_at_phone_neutral

LUCA: Heard Marisol's running her mouth in first period.

SELENA: About what.

LUCA: You.

@selena look phone_lowering_breath_in

SELENA: Specifically.

@luca look one_corner_up_dry

LUCA: Specifically that you "stole Diego, then stole me, and your dad raised you in a barn." That last part was hers. Originality has never been her thing.

SELENA: Charming.

@luca look pushing_off_lockers_steady

LUCA: Want me to handle it?

@selena look eyes_lifting_sharp

YOU: Want me to handle it.

YOU: Three days ago that sentence would have been a full Luca production — flexed shoulders, exaggerated chivalry, a joke about being a knight. Today it is — flat. Plain. He means it.

YOU: That's the new tone of him. That's the version that scares me.

@luca look easy_quiet_eyes_steady

LUCA: I'm not gonna make a thing. One conversation in the hallway. She'll back off by lunch. Done.

SELENA: Lukey —

@luca look small_nod_taking_step

LUCA: Yeah?

@selena look shoulder_dropping_breath

SELENA: Just — stay here. Don't go anywhere.

@luca look easy_grin_returning_small

LUCA: Bet, Greeny.

@selena look chin_dropping_jaw_set

YOU: I don't know what I'm doing yet.

YOU: I just know I don't want him to handle it.

YOU: I don't even know why.

@selena hide
@luca hide

@pause for 1

// BEAT 3 — School courtyard. Lunch. Remi knows everything.

@bg set school_cafeteria fade
@music crossfade theme_courtyard_lunch

@remi show waving_at_table at left
@selena show tray_lowering at right

YOU: Remi Calvano. My best friend since seventh grade. The only person on this planet who has license to tell me I'm being stupid and watch me agree with her.

REMI: Lena.

SELENA: Rem.

@remi look chin_lifted_serious

REMI: We're skipping the courtyard. Come.

SELENA: Where.

REMI: Field. Bleachers. Corner under the announcers' booth.

@selena look eyebrow_up_skeptical

SELENA: That sounds like an intervention.

REMI: It is.

@selena hide
@remi hide

@pause for 1

// BEAT 4 — School field. Bleachers corner. Remi unloads.

@bg set school_gym fade
@music crossfade theme_field_quiet_wind

@remi show leaning_on_railing_steady at left
@selena show tray_in_lap_breath at right

YOU: We are under the announcers' booth. Wind. Empty bleachers. Remi has her sandwich in one hand and her serious face on, which is a face most people never see.

@remi look one_breath_eyes_steady

REMI: Lukey just told Marisol Quintero to "find a better chew toy" in the middle of the AP hallway.

@selena look breath_in_held

SELENA: He said he wouldn't make a thing.

REMI: He didn't make a thing. He made a sentence. A single sentence. Marisol cried in the bathroom for nine minutes. I have a witness.

SELENA: God.

@remi look small_grin_no_amusement

REMI: That's not why I dragged you out here.

@remi look shifting_facing_her_full

REMI: Lena. Listen.

@remi look one_long_breath_steady

REMI: I have known Luca Bellamy since fifth grade. I dated him for six weeks in tenth. We are very stable platonic exes. I know things about him that he forgets I know.

@remi look eyes_lifting_to_clouds_distant

REMI: When we were ten, we got busted for breaking the principal's window with a tennis ball. I threw it. He told the principal he threw it. His mom — Tatiana — was already gone, his dad was — his dad. He took the suspension because he didn't want me grounded.

REMI: We were ten.

@remi look eyes_back_to_her

REMI: Twelfth grade I almost got expelled because someone caught me vaping behind the gym. Luca walked into the dean's office that afternoon and said the vape was his, he'd asked me to hold it, sorry, my bad.

REMI: It was mine.

@remi look small_breath_jaw_loose

REMI: He has been doing this since he was old enough to say "it was me."

@remi look eyes_steady_deliberate

REMI: He covers. He absorbs. He stands in front. He does it for MJ when MJ broke a window. He does it for Priya when his dad goes off about dinner. He did it for me twice that I know about and four times I'd guess at.

REMI: It looks like love. Sometimes it is. But mostly it is what he does instead of having a feeling. He is pathologically incapable of letting somebody he cares about take a hit.

REMI: He is seventeen.

REMI: He has been carrying everybody's shit for ten years.

@remi look turning_to_her_eyes_locked

REMI: Lena. I love that boy. I am asking you, as someone who loves him for a different reason than you do — don't be the next person he carries.

@remi look one_breath_voice_low

REMI: He is going to want to. He's gonna offer. He's gonna handle Marisol, handle Diego, handle your mom, handle the world, handle the weather. And he is gonna do it well, and he is gonna do it fast, and he is gonna feel like he is being a good boyfriend.

REMI: Don't let him.

@remi look small_grin_returning_dry

REMI: Make him sit down sometimes. He doesn't know how. You're gonna have to teach him.

@selena look eyes_lifting_wet

SELENA: Rem.

REMI: Yeah.

SELENA: I don't know how to teach a boy to sit down.

REMI: Welcome to it.

@remi look leaning_back_into_railing

REMI: Eat your sandwich. I'm done.

@selena hide
@remi hide

@pause for 1

// BEAT 5 — Selena's car. After school. Luca in the passenger seat.

@bg set selena_house_porch fade
@music crossfade theme_drive_home_quiet

@selena show driver_seat_eyes_road at left
@luca show passenger_arm_on_window at right

YOU: I'm driving him home this time. I told him I'd drop him at his place. I did not tell him why.

YOU: He's looking out the window. He has been looking out the window for the whole light cycle on Sycamore.

@luca look small_breath_quiet

LUCA: Greeny.

SELENA: Lukey.

LUCA: I gotta tell you a thing.

@selena look glance_sideways_quick

SELENA: Okay.

@luca look eyes_to_dashboard_steady

LUCA: That dinner.

LUCA: At my house. Couple of months ago. Bellamy. Big fancy. My dad doing his bit about girls and AP.

@selena look chin_lifting_remembering

SELENA: I remember.

@luca look one_breath_eyes_steady

LUCA: Nobody has ever stood up for me in that house. Not Priya — she does it sideways, she has to. Not Diego when he's there. Not me.

LUCA: Not even me.

LUCA: You did.

@luca look glance_sideways_brief

LUCA: I know I didn't say anything that night. I drove you home. I made a joke about something. I went upstairs.

LUCA: I didn't forget, Greeny. I never told you. But I didn't forget.

@selena look hand_tightening_on_wheel

YOU: He isn't asking me to absorb anything.

YOU: He's just — telling me he kept it.

@selena look eyes_to_road_breath

SELENA: Luke.

@luca look small_grin_returning_easy

LUCA: Yeah.

SELENA: That was a real sentence.

LUCA: I have those occasionally.

@luca look one_corner_up_quiet

LUCA: Anyway. Couldn't say it then. Wanted to.

@selena hide
@luca hide

@butterfly "公共段 seed MC_CHOSE_LUCA_AT_DINNER 回调：Luca 在车里告诉 MC 他从没忘那晚她替他怼父亲的事。他没要她为他做更多 — 他只让她知道他记着。"

